{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0053_1000_p", "source_sha256": "33291abc95118f1d6cecac36515b2b5335d8b9ac2dbb0309a00b72eab99cfca9", "ja": "（今日は、時代劇をテーマにした撮影だ。\nそろそろ始まる時間だが……翼がいないぞ？）", "zh": "（今天是以时代剧为主题的摄影。\n就快要开始拍摄了……但怎么没看见翼？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0053_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d9002fef77ecfefee5e355c301fd86722ea98a7584b86730357980381be0c372", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}さん！\nお城の前で、一緒に記念写真撮りましょうよ～。", "zh": "欸欸，{$P$}先生！\n我们去城堡前面一起拍纪念照好不好～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0053_1002_p", "source_sha256": "9a057bce6039d5bd6d992ad03f2180d626c6ffe7220c0576f86fc34c617a6112", "ja": "あっ、翼。これから仕事だぞ。\n観光に来たんじゃないんだから……。", "zh": "啊，翼，接下来要开始工作了。\n我们可不是来观光的啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0053_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ef7666192c25c92aee9e7d79fdcd7eed9ded96056d5fe99aa0204a65e2dd96e7", "ja": "でも、まだ着替えも始まってないですし。\nまだ大丈夫！　写真撮りましょうよ～。", "zh": "可是，反正都还没换上服装嘛。\n还来得及啦！我们去拍照吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0053_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c39dd6c3c5e9535da10c82cbf34db1863a71a08176da420c01f0947db0f17699", "ja": "緊張感がないな……。殺陣が面白いって、\n最初はすごくやる気になってたじゃないか。", "zh": "你也太悠哉了……当初你不是觉得武打动作很有趣，\n跃跃欲试的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0053_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1a088ae6172d625f44938e41cae7c2766894a407fa815e545555f8d49d95057f", "ja": "だって、もう全部覚えちゃったんだもん。\nそれにお侍さんって、モテなさそう……。", "zh": "因为那些动作我全都记住啦。\n而且武士感觉就不会有异性缘……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0053_1006_p", "source_sha256": "304e02e423dd776aa78aaca2d6d7f03f8f7f30acde37afcd6f70c1b65457bc0e", "ja": "いや、そんなことはないぞ？\n最近は歴史とか刀剣とか、人気があるからな！", "zh": "不会啊，我倒不这么觉得。\n最近历史或刀剑题材很有人气喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0053_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "98acc95e685fa4e517ef237c9445ed361d46780239a574abe274d7ba64fe9546", "ja": "えっ、本当ですか？\nじゃあわたしも、モテモテになっちゃうかも……？", "zh": "什么？真的吗？\n所以我也可能会变成万人迷啰……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0053_1008_p", "source_sha256": "886e2c72b13b465a885f06d4aff2a3fed8bfc0768fe09ee216a7ada82879657b", "ja": "ああ。それに翼の殺陣は本当にかっこいいからな。\nきっとモテモテになるはずだ！", "zh": "没错。而且你的武打真的非常帅，\n肯定会大受欢迎！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0053_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e0db515abad5b9c3bfb5abeab81890c0a463b5e7adb6d505e3427a95957e4d9f", "ja": "えへへ、{$P$}さんに、ほめられ\nちゃった♪　なら、ちょっとだけ頑張ってみようかな！", "zh": "嘿嘿，{$P$}先生夸奖我耶♪\n那我就稍微努力一下下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0053_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ebc8f1cff8b82c239cf3eb5ce7c9d9f5554764db14fd5964687612ef384fb483", "ja": "あ、でもでも、ツーショットは撮ってくださいね？\n約束ですよ～！", "zh": "啊，不过不过，待会还是要和我合照喔。\n说好啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
